Date: Fri, 14 Aug 2026 19:56:45 -0300
Subject: [PATCH 8/8] feat(wiki): unified full-stack wiki editor integrated
 with odysseus

- Exposed WikiDB CRUD operations through reins_routes.py
- Replaced the simple search-only UI with a split-pane editor
- Allows for creating, updating, and deleting both Pages and Memories directly from the Odysseus UI
---
